{"video":{"bvid":"BV1BmYw69Edr","aid":117362900604547,"title":"黑手党老大的禁忌妹夫","cover":"/media/BV1BmYw69Edr/cover.jpg","duration":4423,"pubdate":1790815964,"owner":{"mid":"3546573669664984","name":"在云的背面种花","face":"https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/face/a11429496b79a4a022981e7f026e03837e332205.jpg"},"stat":{"view":3285,"danmaku":86,"reply":47,"favorite":104,"coin":42,"share":6,"like":173},"statKnown":true,"tname":"","tags":["黑帮","影视剪辑","爱情","黑手党","禁忌","剪辑","同性","AI","人工智能"],"status":{"ok":false,"source":"member","code":-4,"message":"已锁定","reason":"收到权利人StoReel US Inc.就<《Mafia Boss’s Forbidden Brother-in-Law》>关于您稿件的侵权投诉并根据其要求及著作权法等相关法律规定对该稿件进行下线处理","checked_at":"2026-11-16 12:12:24","public_code":-404,"public_message":"啥都木有"},"archivedAt":"2026-11-16 10:05:08","updatedAt":"2026-11-16 12:12:24","comments":{"roots":34,"subs":13,"total":47,"siteCount":47,"crawlTime":"2026-11-16 12:12:24"},"danmaku":86,"reupload":[],"reuploadOf":[],"noReupload":false,"desc":"Leo, a poor college student, takes a deal from his classmate Ella to pretend to be the father of her unborn baby, so he can afford medical treatment for his sick mother. He goes home with Ella to face her brother Jay, a feared mafia boss. Leo once drunkenly made bold advances toward Jay on a cruise, leading Jay to mistakenly believe Leo has deceived his sister. When Ella leaves for France, the two are forced to live together. Jay arranges top‑notch medical care for Leo’s mother, and tender feelings slowly grow between them. After uncovering the fake engagement agreement, consumed by possessiveness, Jay sleeps with Leo. They live in an awkward dynamic while hostile mafia factions target Leo as his weakness. Through a dangerous kidnapping crisis, Leo witnesses Jay’s genuine devotion. After Ella marries her baby’s real father, Jay brings Leo back to their fateful cruise to confess his love.\n家境贫寒的大学生 Leo 为了支付母亲的医疗费，接受了同学 Ella 提出的交易——假装成她腹中孩子的父亲。\nLeo 跟随 Ella 回家，见到了她令人闻风丧胆的哥哥——黑手党首领 Jay。两人其实早有一段尴尬的过往：Leo 曾在一次邮轮旅行中醉酒，大胆地向 Jay 示爱。如今再次见面，Jay 却误以为 Leo 欺骗并伤害了自己的妹妹，对他充满敌意。\nElla 前往法国后，Leo 与 Jay 被迫住在同一屋檐下。Jay 为 Leo 的母亲安排了最好的医疗条件，而两人在朝夕相处中，也逐渐对彼此产生了温柔而隐秘的感情。\n当 Jay 发现所谓的订婚只是一纸虚假协议后，强烈的占有欲令他彻底失控，与 Leo 发生了关系。此后，两人陷入了一段亲密却尴尬的暧昧关系。\n与此同时，敌对的黑帮势力发现 Leo 已经成为 Jay 唯一的软肋，于是将目标对准了他。一场危险的绑架危机，让 Leo 亲眼见证了 Jay 深藏在冷酷外表之下的真心与不顾一切。\n最终，Ella 与孩子真正的父亲结婚。Jay 则带着 Leo 重返那艘让他们命运交汇的邮轮，向他坦白了埋藏已久的爱意。\nhttps://pan.baidu.com/s/1yJ8PSvLapHlgJOIsEvJefw?pwd=k10l\n\nhttps://pan.quark.cn/s/efb673be02df?pwd=Zzy6","descV2":[{"raw_text":"Leo, a poor college student, takes a deal from his classmate Ella to pretend to be the father of her unborn baby, so he can afford medical treatment for his sick mother. He goes home with Ella to face her brother Jay, a feared mafia boss. Leo once drunkenly made bold advances toward Jay on a cruise, leading Jay to mistakenly believe Leo has deceived his sister. When Ella leaves for France, the two are forced to live together. Jay arranges top‑notch medical care for Leo’s mother, and tender feelings slowly grow between them. After uncovering the fake engagement agreement, consumed by possessiveness, Jay sleeps with Leo. They live in an awkward dynamic while hostile mafia factions target Leo as his weakness. Through a dangerous kidnapping crisis, Leo witnesses Jay’s genuine devotion. After Ella marries her baby’s real father, Jay brings Leo back to their fateful cruise to confess his love.\n家境贫寒的大学生 Leo 为了支付母亲的医疗费，接受了同学 Ella 提出的交易——假装成她腹中孩子的父亲。\nLeo 跟随 Ella 回家，见到了她令人闻风丧胆的哥哥——黑手党首领 Jay。两人其实早有一段尴尬的过往：Leo 曾在一次邮轮旅行中醉酒，大胆地向 Jay 示爱。如今再次见面，Jay 却误以为 Leo 欺骗并伤害了自己的妹妹，对他充满敌意。\nElla 前往法国后，Leo 与 Jay 被迫住在同一屋檐下。Jay 为 Leo 的母亲安排了最好的医疗条件，而两人在朝夕相处中，也逐渐对彼此产生了温柔而隐秘的感情。\n当 Jay 发现所谓的订婚只是一纸虚假协议后，强烈的占有欲令他彻底失控，与 Leo 发生了关系。此后，两人陷入了一段亲密却尴尬的暧昧关系。\n与此同时，敌对的黑帮势力发现 Leo 已经成为 Jay 唯一的软肋，于是将目标对准了他。一场危险的绑架危机，让 Leo 亲眼见证了 Jay 深藏在冷酷外表之下的真心与不顾一切。\n最终，Ella 与孩子真正的父亲结婚。Jay 则带着 Leo 重返那艘让他们命运交汇的邮轮，向他坦白了埋藏已久的爱意。\nhttps://pan.baidu.com/s/1yJ8PSvLapHlgJOIsEvJefw?pwd=k10l\n\nhttps://pan.quark.cn/s/efb673be02df?pwd=Zzy6","type":1,"biz_id":0}],"dynamic":""